The mutated file's unified diff goes on stdout with ---, +++ and @@ header lines; the summary goes to stderr.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
status: draft
title: Probe plan
sp: 0
---

Body paragraph one.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md status=ready
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 ---
-status: draft
+status: ready
 title: Probe plan
 sp: 0
 ---
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: status=ready
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
status: ready
title: Probe plan
sp: 0
---

Body paragraph one.
-- exit --
0
